    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "b18fd7b0-3063-4b8d-9020-69abf338a97c",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Dr. HUSH&apos;s fear",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130686958175",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6927fbc1-8cbb-4c7a-9098-0b041fe120df).Image",
        "Description": "It has been a while. How has everyone been? Oh, is that so? Right off the bat, do you all believe in fortune telling? In my case, I just can&apos;t trust it. Some people call me a typical Virgo type A. Despite his intelligence, he is easily swayed by emotions and is surprisingly clumsy. His personality is nervous and quite tenacious. It&apos;s definitely true. But the most important thing is that I&apos;m neither type A nor a Virgo. Speaking of fortune telling...",
